Best for #290: implement the self-contained benchmark runner as part of this issue.

It directly satisfies the missing acceptance criteria without relying on a developer’s manually configured database:

- disposable PostgreSQL only;
- deterministic 300-fixture corpus;
- normal ingestion path;
- temporary backend process;
- existing API timing script;
- generated plan and P95 evidence;
- automatic cleanup.

Keep it focused: no new infrastructure service, Docker requirement, or production configuration change. The existing #289 generator and timing script are reused; #290 adds the orchestration and records before/after evidence.

